You can find the implementation [here](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnet-api-versioning/tree/main/src/AspNetCore/WebApi/src/Asp.Versioning.Http/Builder). You can find a full example [here](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnet-api-versioning/tree/main/examples/AspNetCore/WebApi/MinimalApiExample). API Versioning 6.0 will target .NET 6.0 and be released prior to .NET 7.0; however, if at all possible, I want to align signatures. This ensures source compatibility and makes the transition from 6.0 to 7.0 less painful.

